          "paragraphId": "new-v46-p6",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "7383448c5ad850b788cc45cfb22d9bf718a28c52f178d37de0c555f7058b0d6c",
          "excerpt": "行至鄭州，聞晉大臣多為契丹所鎖，中夜惶惑，解衣帶就馬櫪自經而卒，年六十二。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v286",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v286-p3",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "10245802f5d3c27989ae276464e8e5344997f60fc59dfd4ca237bbcf955c941f",
          "excerpt": "高祖睿文聖武昭肅孝皇帝上天福十二年（丁未，公元九四七年）"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v286",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v286-p4",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "e54c6118e6096f1cc207606de817130fc95170693509c9420249ced587f1bc75",
          "excerpt": "春，正月，丁亥朔，百官遙辭晉主於城北，乃易素服紗帽，迎契丹主，伏路側請罪。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v286",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v286-p20",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "f850ae09806621f688b3c5a7c8bf66ecca8b164ecdf060766951e553eb8daf8b",
          "excerpt": "乙卯，在禮至鄭州，聞繼勳被鎖，大驚，夜，自經於馬櫪間。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
