          "originalSha256": "3ef90e43c646e8069577903b57b5fe1beb596db71249ae88ecbf38261feab1d6",
          "excerpt": "明宗即位，拜在禮義成軍節度使，在禮不受命，遂拜鄴都留守、興唐尹。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v036",
          "paragraphId": "old-v036-p2",
